interaction of adriamycin with the formaldehyde-releasing prodrug pivaloyloxymethyl butyrate (AN-9)</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2001</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>8194</fpage><lpage>8202</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||61|8194||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11719450</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>DeVita</surname><given-names>VT</given-names></name><name><surname>Hellman</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenberg</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title/><source>Principles and Practice of Oncology</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Philadelphia: Lippincott Williams and Wilkins</publisher-name>6th edn</citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Elbl</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Hrstkova</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Tomaskova</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Michalek</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Late anthracycline cardiotoxicity protection by dexrazoxane (ICRF-187) in pediatric patients: echocardiographic follow-up</article-title><source>Support Care Cancer</source><year>2006</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>128</fpage><lpage>136</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Support Care Cancer||14|128||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16034614</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Engel</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Nudelman</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Levovich</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Gruss-Fischer</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Entin-Meer</surname><given-na